c21: $ … ⇒ w ∊ 𝒫 (⋃ (cdm S) ∪ cdm S) × crn S $ by wcel_welc [c20]
c22: $ … ⇒ w ∊ csn ⟨ ∅ , A ⟩ ∪ (𝒫 (⋃ (cdm S) ∪ cdm S) × crn S) $ by cun_intro_r [c21]
d1: $ G , ∃ y (w = ⟨ suc i , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ S) ⇒ ∃ y (w = ⟨ suc i , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ S) $ by ax
d2: $ … ⇒ w ∊ csn ⟨ ∅ , A ⟩ ∪ (𝒫 (⋃ (cdm S) ∪ cdm S) × crn S) $ by ex_elim [d1, c22]
